# GMS rolls an L% chance of L*2% more damage, which comes to 2% at its master
# level -- so 2% is what the flat lever reaches. The 1% HP it hands back on a
# trigger becomes a share of the pool on every attack, on Self Recovery's
# ladder. The MP half is dropped: there is no MP pool to fill.
name: "Mortal Blow"
skill_order: 5
description: "Permanently increases Damage, and recovers HP as you attack."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SNIPER
max_level: 10
base { damage_pct: 0.002 hp_recover_pct: 0.001 }
per_level { damage_pct: 0.002 hp_recover_pct: 0.001 }
